{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":63,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1912672,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1460029726,"LastPoster":{"Id":286470,"Name":"amberguesa","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286470.jpg?_r=1457927739","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1912672,"PostDate":1460029726,"PostContent":"Hello!  Just beginning to plan my destination wedding and don't even know where to start. Here is...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmitch829@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460027615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bmitch829","Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9306f60a301159b25e0f3f255b3ab9ca","RawContent":"Hello! \n\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don&#039;t even know where to start. Here is what I do know...\n\n\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don&#039;t want to get married on the beach.\n\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don&#039;t want to break the bank.\n\nI&#039;m traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.\n\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.\n\nI&#039;m thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.\n\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.\n\n\nThat&#039;s pretty much all I have and I&#039;m open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!\n\n\nBecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1912672,"PostDate":1460029726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! <br>\nJust beginning to plan my destination wedding and don't even know where to start. Here is what I do know...<br><br>\nI want to go somewhere warm and beachy but I don't want to get married on the beach.<br>\nI am looking for an all-inclusive resort but don't want to break the bank.<br>\nI'm traveling from Massachusetts and also have 2 children under 5 but will have my whole family for help.<br>\nMy mom is a teacher and I do need to work around a regular school schedule so thinking possibly February vacation for April vacation.<br>\nI'm thinking possibly Mexico or the Dominican.<br>\nWe have a rather small group that will be attending.<br><br>\nThat's pretty much all I have and I'm open to any suggestions. I feel so confused in this world and want to set things in stone so we can start saving. Help!<br><br>\nBecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmitch829@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.106.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460027615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bmitch829","Id":286671,"Name":"Bmitch829","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac7331a371933ccb0cb5ae8eb45ba17c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bmitch829\"] Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! The first place to start is the hunt for a great Travel Agent. Do you have one yet? The owners of this site can definitely help you if you are still searching for one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From your list of requirements the resort that I was married at this January might be a good fit. The only thing is the price per person. It is definitely not one of the cheapest resorts but we were able to secure a good rate (Azul Fives). I&#039;m from Canada so our packages work differently. We paid $1630 (CDN) from Toronto that included a flight for 7 days. I would say April is probably a more affordable option in comparison to Feb. If you are working around a teaching schedule you may also want to look at the summer months as prices tend to drop.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Azul Fives:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Family Friendly&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Several non beach locations to choose from (Sky Terrace -free, Pier, Beachfront location, Sky Deck for an additional charge)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Sky Terrace (this is where I was married)&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pier (sorry not a great pic)&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;(New)Beachfront Location&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Sky Deck&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any questions about Azul Fives. The add ons can definitely start to get costly but you can definitely have a budget friendly beautiful wedding at this resort...but then again I&#039;m a bit biased! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912675,"PostDate":1460031495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286671\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286671-bmitch829\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Bmitch829<\/span><\/a> Welcome and congrats on your engagement!! The first place to start is the hunt for a great Travel Agent. Do you have one yet? The owners of this site can definitely help you if you are still searching for one.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From your list of requirements the resort that I was married at this January might be a good fit. The only thing is the price per person. It is definitely not one of the cheapest resorts but we were able to secure a good rate (Azul Fives). I'm from Canada so our packages work differently. We paid $1630 (CDN) from Toronto that included a flight for 7 days. I would say April is probably a more affordable option in comparison to Feb. If you are working around a teaching schedule you may also want to look at the summer months as prices tend to drop.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Azul Fives:<\/p>\n<p>*Family Friendly<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>*Several non beach locations to choose from (Sky Terrace -free, Pier, Beachfront location, Sky Deck for an additional charge)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Sky Terrace (this is where I was married)<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-21888200-1460049139.jpg\" title=\"12801293_10156541706005366_8453295964567052482_n.jpg - Size: 83.92KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-21888200-1460049139.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12801293_10156541706005366_8453295964567052482_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Pier (sorry not a great pic)<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-94496400-1460049237.jpg\" title=\"12592294_10156492773180578_9089099019274090944_n.jpg - Size: 71.34KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-94496400-1460049237.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"12592294_10156492773180578_9089099019274090944_n.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>(New)Beachfront Location<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-79036000-1460049275.jpg\" title=\"Oceanfront location2.jpg - Size: 54.54KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-79036000-1460049275.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Oceanfront location2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Sky Deck<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1912675]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-65323000-1460049293.jpg\" title=\"floral arrangements1.jpg - Size: 88.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2016\/post-281055-0-65323000-1460049293.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"floral arrangements1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any questions about Azul Fives. The add ons can definitely start to get costly but you can definitely have a budget friendly beautiful wedding at this resort...but then again I'm a bit biased! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415529511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.120.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c81a077578dd5bb1d4fe5205e1cc9bb0","RawContent":"I started by googling best destination wedding locations in Jamaica. I found an article that listed about 12 locations with details. I needed a family friendly all inclusive location too. I copied the list and visited each site and was able to find what I feel will be perfect for us!  Good luck and I hope this helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1912676,"PostDate":1460033680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I started by googling best destination wedding locations in Jamaica. I found an article that listed about 12 locations with details. I needed a family friendly all inclusive location too. I copied the list and visited each site and was able to find what I feel will be perfect for us!  Good luck and I hope this helps!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadesha.benson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453544302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286018.jpg?_r=1459635518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Endreece","Id":286018,"Name":"Endreece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.97.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80031,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74120ed76f9fdc1ae6b9fe50afe02711","RawContent":"I&#039;m having mine at dreams punta can in the DR. It is kid friendly and they have a few options that aren&#039;t the beach. They have a few different packages you can choose from. \n\n\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1912685,"PostDate":1460044848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm having mine at dreams punta can in the DR. It is kid friendly and they have a few options that aren't the beach. They have a few different packages you can choose from. <br><br>\nSent from my SAMSUNG-SM-G900A using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abyrnes319@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.97.47","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1457909736,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286470.jpg?_r=1457927739","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberguesa","Id":286470,"Name":"amberguesa","IsOnline"